 "remarks": "Make sure to add this Sheffield Ridge unit to your must-see list. This unit is situated near Norwalk Hospital, South Norwalk, and the SoNo Mall. Commuters will appreciate the quick access to 95, Route 7, the Merritt Parkway, and the Norwalk train station. Added convenience includes two off-street parking spots in a gated lot with additional street parking. Residents will enjoy heat, gas for cooking, and hot water included in the HOA .On-site laundry and an intercom entry system round out the convenience of this unit, while accessibility features include an elevator to access the unit and parking. Come visit this convenient and well-located Shefield Ridge home soon!",
